// CITS5017 Lectures 6–7 (one shared deck): Convolutional AEs, Denoising AEs, Variational AEs, GANs, DCGANs.
// Pure data for the Gradient Arcade. Every item cites the exact slide(s) of
// Documents/cits5017/lectures/cits5017-lect06-07-AE-conv-var-GAN.pdf (32 slides).
// Sources: the PDF (text layer + rendered PNGs for every equation/figure/code slide) and the
// transcript Documents/cits5017/markdown-lecs/lecture-6-7.md (its Quirks were re-verified on the PDF).
// Items flagged `beyond: true` are NOT on the slides; their `note` says why they are here.
// Notation follows the slides: μ, σ, γ = log(σ²), script ℒ for the latent loss, n = codings' dimension.

export const LECTURE = 6;
export const TITLE = 'Topics 6&7: Convolutional AEs, Denoising AEs, Variational AEs, GANs, and DCGANs';
export const SLIDE_COUNT = 32;

